<Mod id="3ea46c4f-6e13-46bf-ba28-71a3ffa85b53" version="12">
  <Properties>
    <Name>(Unity) - GH's Louisiana - Joseph Beausoleil Broussard for VP</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser>[ICON_BULLET]Adds [COLOR_CYAN]Louisiana[ENDCOLOR], under the great Joseph Broussard, a.k.a. Beausoleil! as a playable Civilization.
			[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Requires at least the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]4.2[ENDCOLOR] version of Vox Populi and MUCfVP (tested also with VP4.21.1).</Teaser>
    <Description>Adds Louisiana, under the great Joseph Broussard, a.k.a. Beausoleil!</Description>
    <Authors>Gwennog et Hinin</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>look at the forum page</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
